{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-67980","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-129414","text":"FleetPrompt Documentation"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-67982","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129415","marks":["bold"],"text":"The open marketplace where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed in one click."}]}],"id":"blk-67981","kind":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-67984","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129416","marks":["bold"],"text":"Part of the [&] Protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-129417","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-129418","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/ECOSYSTEM.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem overview"},{"id":"spn-129419","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-129420","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/THREE_PROTOCOL_STACK.md"}],"text":"Three-protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-129421","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-129422","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"Stack status"}]}],"id":"blk-67983","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-67985","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129423","text":"Welcome to the documentation hub for "},{"id":"spn-129424","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"},{"id":"spn-129425","text":" — the open agent marketplace for the [&] Protocol ecosystem. FleetPrompt is the registry where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed. Every listed agent carries a versioned manifest, a computed trust score, declared permissions, and a linked SpecPrompt spec — making FleetPrompt the first marketplace where you know exactly what an agent does before you install it."}]},{"id":"blk-67986","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-129426","text":"Why FleetPrompt?"}]},{"id":"blk-67987","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129427","text":"57% of organizations now have AI agents in production (LangChain 2026). Yet there are "},{"id":"spn-129428","marks":["bold"],"text":"zero open agent marketplaces"},{"id":"spn-129429","text":". Teams build agents in isolation, rediscover the same patterns, and have no way to share, reuse, or monetize production-quality work. Closed platforms (Salesforce AgentForce, OpenAI GPT Store) lock agents into proprietary runtimes. Open frameworks (LangGraph, CrewAI) have no distribution story at all."}]},{"id":"blk-67988","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129430","text":"FleetPrompt is the "},{"id":"spn-129431","marks":["bold"],"text":"distribution layer"},{"id":"spn-129432","text":" of the [&] Protocol ecosystem:"}]},{"id":"blk-67989","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (Standards)    → defines agent behavior as versioned specs\n    ↓\nAgentelic (Engineering)   → builds, tests, deploys agents against specs\n    ↓\nOpenSentience (Runtime)   → governs, executes, observes agents locally\n    ↓\nGraphonomous (Memory)     → continual learning knowledge graphs\n    ↓\nFleetPrompt (Distribution) ← THIS  ·  Delegatic (Orchestration)"},{"id":"blk-67990","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-129433","text":"Documentation Map"}]},{"id":"blk-67991","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129434","marks":["bold"],"text":"Homepages"}]},{"id":"blk-67992","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-67994","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129435","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://ampersandboxdesign.com"}],"text":"[&] Ampersand Box"}]}],"id":"blk-67993","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-67996","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129436","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://graphonomous.com"}],"text":"Graphonomous"}]}],"id":"blk-67995","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-67998","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129437","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://bendscript.com"}],"text":"BendScript"}]}],"id":"blk-67997","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-68000","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-129438","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","targe